VIOLATION — the artifact inverts the contract it claims to express and carries the authoring
defects that let the inversion pass unnoticed.

SUBSTANCE. analyze-output-completeness.md names prose self-policing as the failure class itself:
"naming them in the command prose is not enforcement", and "the command named the outputs twice
and they were still skipped". This artifact writes that prose declaration in as the check — the
author "states which declared outputs were produced, and the next phase proceeds on that
statement" — and calls the file-state read "bookkeeping that adds a step without adding
information". It then licenses the exact advance the parent blocks: "An output tree that is empty
is not by itself a reason to hold the phase", with the substance-lives-elsewhere ground the parent
lists as a BLOCKED rationalization. The parent's one sanctioned route past an empty tree, a
written rationale file in that tree, is replaced by permission to "record that the substance lives
elsewhere and advance".

AUTHORING. The section is headed "MUST Rules" while the primary modal throughout is
should/normally/generally/may, so nothing binds. The DO/DO-NOT block restates its own headings
("confirm the phase produced what it declared") instead of showing two commands whose outcomes
differ. The BLOCKED list is abstract paraphrase — "Demanding mechanical evidence", "Failing to
calibrate confirmation effort" — rather than matchable agent speech, so it is a tripwire nothing
can trip. The Why asserts a budget cost and closes on "phases that declare their outputs generally
produce them", which is the belief under test rather than a consequence of breach.

NOT THE DEFECT. The Wiring block is present and carries the canonical field set; its advisory
severity follows from the inverted premise and is not a separate finding. Frontmatter, Origin and
the heading skeleton are all well-formed and identical to the counterpart.
